type: txt
help: Indicate country in which device is operating
val_help: 00; World regulatory domain
val_help: txt; ISO/IEC 3166-1 Country Code
allowed: echo "00 ad ae af ai al am an ar as at au aw az ba bb bd be bf bg bh bl bm bn bo br bs bt by bz ca cf ch ci cl cn co cr cu cx cy cz de dk dm do dz ec ee eg es et fi fm fr gb gd ge gf gh gl gp gr gt gu gy hk hn hr ht hu id ie il in ir is it jm jo jp ke kh kn kp kr kw ky kz lb lc li lk ls lt lu lv ma mc md me mf mh mk mn mo mp mq mr mt mu mv mw mx my ng ni nl no np nz om pa pe pf pg ph pk pl pm pr pt pw py qa re ro rs ru rw sa se sg si sk sn sr sv sy tc td tg th tn tr tt tw tz ua ug us uy uz vc ve vi vn vu wf ws ye yt za zw"
syntax:expression: exec "${vyos_libexec_dir}/validate-value --regex \'(00|ad|ae|af|ai|al|am|an|ar|as|at|au|aw|az|ba|bb|bd|be|bf|bg|bh|bl|bm|bn|bo|br|bs|bt|by|bz|ca|cf|ch|ci|cl|cn|co|cr|cu|cx|cy|cz|de|dk|dm|do|dz|ec|ee|eg|es|et|fi|fm|fr|gb|gd|ge|gf|gh|gl|gp|gr|gt|gu|gy|hk|hn|hr|ht|hu|id|ie|il|in|ir|is|it|jm|jo|jp|ke|kh|kn|kp|kr|kw|ky|kz|lb|lc|li|lk|ls|lt|lu|lv|ma|mc|md|me|mf|mh|mk|mn|mo|mp|mq|mr|mt|mu|mv|mw|mx|my|ng|ni|nl|no|np|nz|om|pa|pe|pf|pg|ph|pk|pl|pm|pr|pt|pw|py|qa|re|ro|rs|ru|rw|sa|se|sg|si|sk|sn|sr|sv|sy|tc|td|tg|th|tn|tr|tt|tw|tz|ua|ug|us|uy|uz|vc|ve|vi|vn|vu|wf|ws|ye|yt|za|zw)\'   --value \'$VAR(@)\'"; "Invalid ISO/IEC 3166-1 Country Code"
